  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.33 Player-funded promotion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.33 “Player-funded promotion” means a special cash prize awarded in poker games with rake when a player achieves a prescribed type of hand. The jackpot is funded by a small rake taken from each pot. Such promotions include bad beat and high hand jackpots.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.22)",
